OL,3,AMeghan broke contact with father in
OL,4,Aletter citing abuse claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duchess of Sussex broke contact
OL,7,Fwith her father last year, telling him
OL,8,Fshe and the authorities knew he had
OL,9,Fabused young girls, the BBC
OL,10,Funderstands.
OL,12,FSources close to the duchess said
OL,13,FMeghan warned Thomas Markle in a letter
OL,14,Fthat he would never meet his
OL,15,Fgrandchildren.
OL,17,FIt is understood the letter was sent to
OL,18,FMarkle, 82, while he was in hospital in
OL,19,Fthe Philippines after having his leg
OL,20,Famputated.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
