OL,3,AIsrael to close West Bank crossings on
OL,4,Aelection day as crackdown escalates
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Israel Defense Forces announced a
OL,7,F"ban on the entry and exit of
OL,8,FPalestinian workers throughout Judea
OL,9,Fand Samaria and the Jordan Valley,
OL,10,Fincluding industrial zones, as well as
OL,11,Fthe closure of all land crossings" on
OL,12,FTuesday.
OL,14,FIt said most workers would also be
OL,15,Fbarred from settlements from Sunday,
OL,16,Fwith the exception of industrial zones
OL,17,Fand a limited number of other areas.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
