OL,3,AVoters in Brazil head to polls as Lula
OL,4,Agoes up against Bolsonaro's son
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolls have opened in Brazil as people
OL,7,Fchoose their new president in a closely
OL,8,Ffought run-off election.
OL,10,FThe choice is between the 80-year-old
OL,11,Fincumbent, left-winger Luiz Inacio Lula
OL,12,Fda Silva, who is seeking a fourth
OL,13,Fnon-consecutive term in office, and
OL,14,Fright-wing senator Flavio Bolsonaro,
OL,15,F45.
OL,17,FBolsonaro is the son of former
OL,18,Fright-wing president Jair Bolsonaro,
OL,19,Fwho is serving a 27-year prison
OL,20,Fsentence for plotting a coup after
OL,21,Flosing the last election in 2022.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
